DesignFile
  DesignUnit @1:1
    Library @1:1 ieee
    Use @2:1 ieee.std_logic_1164.all
    Entity adder @4:1
      Port @5:9 a, b : in bit
      Port @5:24 s, c : out bit
  DesignUnit @8:1
    Architecture gate @8:1 of adder
      Begin
      SignalAssign @10:3 s <= (xor a b)
      SignalAssign @11:3 c <= (and a b)
  DesignUnit @14:1
    Entity top @14:1
  DesignUnit @17:1
    Architecture structural @17:1 of top
      Component adder @18:3
        Port @19:11 a, b : in bit
        Port @19:26 s, c : out bit
      Signal @21:3 x, y, s0, c0, s1, c1 : bit
      ConfigurationSpec @22:3 for u0 : adder use entity work.adder(gate)
      ConfigurationSpec @23:3 for others : adder use entity work.adder port map (a => a, b => b, s => s, c => c)
      Begin
      Instance u0 @26:3 component adder
        PortMap (x, y, s0, c0)
      Instance u1 @27:3 component adder
        PortMap (a => x, b => y, s => s1, c => c1)
      ForGenerate g @28:3 i in 0 to 1
        Instance ug @29:5 component adder
          PortMap (x, y, open, open)
  DesignUnit @33:1
    Configuration top_cfg @33:1 of top
      Use @34:3 work.all
      BlockConfig @35:3 for structural
        ComponentConfig @36:5 for u0 : adder
          Binding use entity work.adder(gate)
        ComponentConfig @39:5 for u1 : adder
          Binding use configuration work.adder_cfg generic map (W => 1) port map (a => a, b => b, s => s, c => c)
        ComponentConfig @44:5 for all : adder
          Binding use open
        BlockConfig @47:5 for g(0)
          ComponentConfig @48:7 for ug : adder
            Binding use entity work.adder
        BlockConfig @52:5 for g(1 to 1)
          ComponentConfig @53:7 for others : adder
  DesignUnit @59:1
    Configuration adder_cfg @59:1 of adder
      BlockConfig @60:3 for gate
